{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "50c3e0d3430018eea3f0c21d7683f8a0b49515cbcd8787ad1018a360c3f85bc8", "ja": "お姫さまたちのお披露目", "zh": "公主们的首次亮相", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f9371352d4c8ad4dbac8e3ffd6af60f06a08c962197fdef01924d06bfcc40cba", "ja": "Fairy、Angelに続きPrincessチーム\nのお披露目公演が決まった。\n未来達5人は、自分達が担当する\n新曲に胸を高鳴らせ、公演に向けて\nやる気をみなぎらせる。", "zh": "继Fairy、Angel之后，\nPrincess队的首次亮相公演也敲定了。\n包括未来在内的五人听完自己负责的\n新歌之后，个个兴奋不已，\n卯足了干劲要准备公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7a7bbaefe58afd94e6da37519a46f3d552d3c202b88f96b40a579107dbcdd2af", "ja": "（いよいよ公演に向けた準備が始まった。\nまずはPRINCESS STARSのメンバーを集めて……）", "zh": "（终于要开始进行公演的准备工作了。\n首先我得召集『PRINCESS STARS』的成员……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "d5e02128e9f02ee9c982ca1ad309bd17cecac23b39c460aaab88bfa6ba282fa5", "ja": "やったやった～っ！\nやっとPrincessチームの出番なんですね！", "zh": "好耶好耶～！\n终于轮到Princess队出场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "e11c56d10b8ebd7492152ebc0ab3754b668e8f2252ff7bcd2e81fc04aab1e2e9", "ja": "しかも、私達が代表なんて……でへへ♪\n一生懸命頑張ります！", "zh": "还是由我们当代表……嘿嘿♪\n我会拚命努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "3280a683afc30a158ed7ba616628fddcc994ab104133891b9c2901650ec30f22", "ja": "PRINCESS STARS……お姫さまの星。\nこれこそ、姫にぴったりのお仕事なのです！", "zh": "『PRINCESS STARS』……公主的星星。\n这就是最适合公主的工作的呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "dfc69489e58824ae7a2753f65ab16ab0d0cf9d8b2a695ae906f580f588307d86", "ja": "姫はいつでも姫なのですから。……ね？\n期待していいのですよ、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "毕竟公主永远都是公主……呐？\n你大可放心期待演出唷，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "23306b3fdb2ed1e82b52a747f885a50e22b94500fbedca4c98e653ce8416b7b5", "ja": "ああ、2人とも期待してるぞ。\nさて……他のみんなはどうだ、やれそうか？", "zh": "嗯，我很看好你们两个喔。\n那么……其他人有什么想法？有信心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "31ce3580712ac16f67f1b4887b8491dd1dd32761b219378ac924b492713743dd", "ja": "もちろんですよ！　プリンセス公演～♪\nみんなでプリンセス～♪　可奈もプリンセス～♪", "zh": "当然有啊！公主公演～♪\n大家一起当公主～♪可奈也是公主～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "864208d02465ed64a394bf895f777d25763eba63cd972bd27e243cfec44517b7", "ja": "妖精組、天使組のみなさんに負けないよう、精進しなく\nては……。よろしくお願いしますね、仕掛け人さま！", "zh": "我们可要努力修行，不能输给妖精组\n和天使组的各位……万事拜托了，策划执行人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "73879b452b67c3946d75558369bdc6d5a9e2a29267570391acccb591ee5ae7e0", "ja": "わ、私も……そんなに自信はないけど、頑張りますっ！\nここで尻込みしてちゃ、脇役にもなれませんよね！", "zh": "我、我也是……虽然不是很有自信，但我会加油的！\n要是在这时退缩，就连配角也当不上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5d2d132e7db3cc873f9e9f5c4f098cf0ffa463bcb9ae499c15f0e360d9b231b2", "ja": "そうだな、その意気だ。\n主役を勝ち取るつもりで頑張ってほしい。", "zh": "没错，就是这股干劲。\n希望各位以夺取主角之位为目标来努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3df86c55ae7ffbe848ce6c21a323dba50a7e24211cee81969fa5625b7fddaa92", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそく聞いてみようか。\nこれが、このメンバーで歌う新曲だ！", "zh": "那么，马上就来听听吧。\n这首就是你们要唱的新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "c43a35dd9d6f573c63b2d6096d216aaef068bc58bf43de75329f9282e1e21250", "ja": "かっ……かわいい～！\nこの曲、本当に私が歌っていいんですか！？", "zh": "好……好可爱～！\n我真的可以唱这首歌吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "401e7652c691ba1e801ff8ae185af1f7dcc8a16a42fda73a08df0cc61f1032d6", "ja": "もちろん。これはPrincessの、\nみんなのための曲だからな。", "zh": "当然可以，这首歌就是\n为了Princess的各位所写的曲子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "aab09b2022757953427c4389402ca7bff80801928c2e674d5c3568d8c83bef5b", "ja": "はいほー！　姫にぴったりな可愛い曲なのです！\nまるで姫のために作られたみたい、なのです♪", "zh": "Hi Ho！真是适合公主的可爱曲子的呀！\n简直就像是为了公主量身订做的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "15bddaa4783b6a01f46d58dbb74694b5e63cea305d96775b5684264791524b00", "ja": "ああ、なんだかややこしいけど、その通りだ！", "zh": "嗯，这样讲听起来让人有点混乱，但就是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "64d0f1452304d73d1a4154694bb72bfea0f04513b7760d6f2bfa5770daa6a9ad", "ja": "私もこの曲、とってもいいって思いますっ！　お話の\nジャンルで言うと、恋愛コメディみたいな聞き心地で。", "zh": "我也非常喜欢这首歌！\n用故事的类型来比喻的话，听起来就像是恋爱喜剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "95e17bd1202e205e7f7f132d11767789b34cc8a8dc27fa1770419ac399cbc95b", "ja": "はい♪　それでいて凛として、\n姫君ならではの力強さを感じます！", "zh": "对啊♪而且还有一种凛然的美感，\n让人感受到公主特有的坚强意志！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "98e2f9deeb29d3a16c57df6b0aae2333ac99179075771f8ade680690770ac8f5", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}さん！\n公演っていつですか？　早く劇場で歌いたいな～♪", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生！公演是\n什么时候？我好想快点在剧场演唱这首歌唷～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_1018", "source_sha256": "dccaa2e498e666e59aa0b656559cb91caf50920de193510da61273496c5fa7b5", "ja": "まずはレッスン！", "zh": "首先是训练课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cb547f2e6d325ba0cc300e87c4b5587a7cf8bf3357ce6d84e60f4148d6b227e0", "ja": "劇場に出る前に、まずはレッスンからだ。みんなで\n楽しく歌うためにも、しっかり身につけような！", "zh": "上剧场演出前，要先完成训练课程。\n这也是为了到时候能快乐地演唱，大家要认真上课喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2001_026yur", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2002_032emi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2003_036kan", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2004_014mir", "source_sha256": "1fd0a69eb95f2190f809946ab3ca4a0a5a218f70b8ecb5a6264f7aa03ea1dae9", "ja": "は～いっ！（なのです！）", "zh": "好～！（的喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2005_021mat", "source_sha256": "3c568b29f7987cb3717e5520d9c2646c5a434b0b70bab56b196eff3c47c3c120", "ja": "は～い、なのです！", "zh": "好～的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2006_014mir", "source_sha256": "414c70145195cba31c0769a025cb633d14f6935adcad051840ddd760405441a3", "ja": "いっぱいレッスンしようね、可奈♪\nドレミファレッスン～♪　ソラシドレッスン～♪", "zh": "一起好好练习吧，可奈♪\n练练Do Re Mi Fa～♪练练So La Si Do～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2007_036kan", "source_sha256": "0257ca14f3542e472cb6990308eb8522aefb55a3f18577a326ae1c52b2177920", "ja": "わぁ、未来ちゃん上手！　可奈も負けないぞ～♪\nレッスン～楽しみ～♪　レッツシング～♪", "zh": "哇，未来真会唱！可奈才不会输给你～♪\n课程～好期待～♪Let's singing～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2008_p", "source_sha256": "0587666c5f936f97e31cc3d4f071a2ddb23241c41550a6dfe740c1e6f65dc5e4", "ja": "（やっとPrincessの出番だから、みんな、\nいつもより気合いが入っているようだな。いい傾向だ）", "zh": "（终于轮到Princess登场了，大家好像\n比平时都还有干劲，这是不错的倾向。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "690490217cb9d9c5e42fb68c375368bae7df7aad6c033702dd7d5fc9880863fc", "ja": "（彼女たちなら、FairyともAngelともまた違う、\n新たな魅力を見せてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（如果是她们，肯定能展现不同于\nFairy和Angel的全新魅力吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
